LocLongDescription="Free bite attack against any enemies that enter, exit or attack from melee range during the enemy turn. Poisons and stuns the target for one action. Has a <Ability:M31_PA_Lockjaw_Cooldown> Turn(s) cooldown, but only when the attack successfuly hits. Cannot target robots."
